  "details": "After doing many tests\n\n- full lobbies no avatar culling and avatar culling\n\n- Solo worlds, heavy and light\n\n- Particle simulation \n\n- Physics simulations\n\nI've had no improvements or downsides to using Unity 6, I don't know if it's because of my hardware that I've already reached a pinnacle of my max performance meaning that a unity version change would not improve my performance drastically. \n\nHowever this is a good thing to note that I am keeping the same stability as I was on the previous version that changing over will not effect me. \n\nI do know some people have reported leaks and stutters, But everything is fine for me. \n\nHowever I know it's still being worked on and I'll probably edit this feedback later down the line if anything changes significantly enough that changes something for me.",
